  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "Achieving individual goals is a great way for team members to help reach company goals. The objective is to help your team understand that what they are working on as an individual will make a positive difference for the team, organization, and company. \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n ### Align work to high-level goals\n\n \n\n List upcoming tasks that you'll need to delegate to your team. Think of the bigger picture goals or outcomes that each task will achieve. Write out a statement that explains how the task will contribute to the company's future goals. Use words like: change, impact, affect, and goal. \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n ### Reinforce business impacts\n\n \n\n When your team members agree to take on important tasks, frame your appreciation in terms of the impact they have: \"Thank you for committing to doing X, it will help us achieve Y and that's really important for the business because of Z.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d",
